## Data in tables

| Token              | Role        | Example            |
| ------------------ | ----------- | ------------------ |
| `--base-50`        | Background  | Page canvas        |
| `--alt-100`        | Surface     | Code, tables       |
| `--prose-800`      | Text        | Paragraphs         |
| `--accent-600`     | Interaction | Links, highlights  |
| `--traffic-ok-600` | Success     | Confirmations      |

</div>

